\par\par \b \uc2 BUZZ-COMMENT-Swiss  \highlight22\uc2 central bank \highlight\uc2  is not too big to fail\b0\par\par\uc2 218 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2022\par 13:52\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2022 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 March 4 (Reuters) - Just because Switzerland's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  can print an endless supply of francs does not mean its monetary policy will work. It is not stopping the franc rising, and its massive selling of francs failed to address the lack of inflation that prompted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the first place.\par \par \uc2 The \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserve has risen to an absurd level in comparison to the size of the Swiss economy, and where the investment of the proceeds of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  once led to big profits, the surging franc and slumping stocks suggest that big losses are in store.\par \par \uc2 Ironically the surge in commodities prices has finally achieved what \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  couldn't, lifting inflation in \b \highlight22\uc2 Switzerland\b0 \highlight\uc2  to 2.2% yy in February and lessening the need for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Swiss franc gains will peg back CPI allowing the SNB to hold interest rates at their extremely low level to support the economy in the crisis created by war in Ukraine.\par \par \uc2 Unlike inflation the trade surplus which has ballooned five-fold during more than a decade of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  gives Swiss companies the ability to tolerate a stronger franc.\par \par \uc2 For more click on\par \par \uc2 (Jeremy Boulton is a Reuters market analyst. The views expressed are his own)\par \par \uc2 Released: 2022-3-7T12:52:02.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020220304ei3402d3x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
