\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2-Vietnam, Taiwan exceed \uc2 U.S. Treasury \highlight22\uc2 currency \highlight\uc2  thresholds, but no manipulator labels\b0\par\par\uc2 855 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Dezember 2021\par 18:31\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2021 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 (Adds details on Treasury thresholds, story links)\par \par \uc2 By David Lawder and Andrea Shalal\par \par \uc2 Dec 3 (Reuters) - Vietnam and Taiwan again exceeded the \uc2 U.S. Treasury\uc2 's thresholds for possible \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  manipulation and enhanced analysis under a 2015 trade law, but the department on Friday refrained from formally branding them as manipulators.\par \par \uc2 Switzerland also narrowly escaped triggering all three manipulation criteria in the Treasury's latest semi-annual \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  report, thanks to revised, broader measurements for trade and current account surpluses and \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 All three had tripped the Treasury's thresholds in April {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reuters.com/business/us-says-vietnam-switzerland-taiwan-violate-currency-thresholds-2021-04-16"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.reuters.com/business/us-says-vietnam-switzerland-taiwan-violate-\b  \highlight22currency\b0 \highlight22 -thresholds-2021-04-16}}}\uc2  prompting more intensive U.S. engagement to revise their practices. Former President Donald Trump's administration had branded Vietnam and Switzerland as manipulators in December, invoking a 1988 \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  law.\par \par \uc2 In the latest report, the Treasury found that no major trading partners during the year through June 2021 sought to manipulate their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  for a trade advantage or for preventing effective balance of payments adjustments.\par \par \uc2 The department said it would continue to work with Vietnam and Taiwan to address U.S. concerns. For \b \highlight22\uc2 Switzerland\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which tripped only the trade and \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  thresholds, the Treasury said it would continue to conduct an in-depth analysis of the alpine country's practices for another year.\par \par \uc2 Switzerland was moved to the Treasury's "Monitoring List" of major trading partners that merit close attention to their \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  practices, along with 11 other countries that remained on the list: China, Japan, South Korea, Germany, Ireland, Italy, India, Malaysia, Singapore, Thailand, and Mexico.\par \par \uc2 Treasury said it was "satisfied with progress made by Vietnam to date" and would continue engagement started in May with Taiwan.\par \par \uc2 "This engagement includes urging the development of a plan with specific actions to address the underlying causes of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  undervaluation and external imbalances," Treasury said of the Taiwan engagement.\par \par \uc2 The United States in July dropped a threat to impose tariffs on Vietnamese goods after the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  agreed with the \uc2 U.S. Treasury{\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reuters.com/world/asia-pacific/us-trade-agency-drops-tariff-threat-against-vietnam-over-currency-practices-2021-07-23"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.reuters.com/world/asia-pacific/us-trade-agency-drops-tariff-threat-against-vietnam-over-\b  \highlight22currency\b0 \highlight22 -practices-2021-07-23}}}\uc2  to refrain from manipulation and make its exchange rate practices more transparent. The deal followed a Reuters report {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reuters.com/article/us-vietnam-forex-intervention-exclusive-idUSKBN2AB1I4"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.reuters.com/article/us-vietnam-\b  \highlight22forex\b0 \highlight22 -\b  \highlight22intervention\b0 \highlight22 -exclusive-idUSKBN2AB1I4}}}\uc2  that Vietnam had sought to shift its spot dollar purchases to forward purchase contracts with banks to evade the Treasury criteria.\par \par \uc2 MUTED REACTION\par \par \uc2 The Treasury's latest report did not spark any significant immediate moves in the Taiwan dollar, the Vietnamese dong or the Swiss franc.\par \par \uc2 A \uc2 Taiwanese \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  official said discussions with Washington would continue but blamed Taiwan's large trade deficit with the United States on strong demand for technology products fueled by the COVID-19 pandemic and production shifts prompted by U.S. tariffs on Chinese goods.\par \par \uc2 Switzerland's finance ministry repeated its longstanding denial that the country's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  engages in manipulation of the franc for an economic advantage.\par \par \uc2 "\b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign exchange interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  are necessary for Swiss monetary policy in order to maintain appropriate monetary conditions and thus price stability," the ministry said in a statement.\par \par \uc2 CHINA\par \par \uc2 The Treasury report criticized China's lack of transparency in its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  practices, citing a wide discrepancy between the \uc2 People's Bank of China\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  assets and net \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  settlement data, suggesting that state- owned banks were being used to conduct official \b \highlight22\uc2 interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "Treasury will continue to closely monitor China\u8217\'20\'19s use of exchange rate management, capital flow, and macroprudential measures and their potential impact on the exchange rate," it said in the report.\par \par \uc2 A Reuters analysis in June {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reuters.com/world/china/chinas-banks-are-bursting-with-dollars-thats-worry-2021-06-01"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.reuters.com/world/china/chinas-banks-are-bursting-with-dollars-thats-worry-2021-06-01}}}\uc2  found that Chinese banks had amassed over $1 trillion amid little official \uc2 PBOC\b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , posing a risk to the government's ability to control the yuan exchange rate.\par \par \uc2 Treasury Secretary \uc2 Janet Yellen\uc2  told the Reuters Next virtual conference on Thursday that she would continue to engage {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "https://www.reuters.com/markets/rates-bonds/yellen-says-cutting-some-tariffs-chinese-goods-could-ease-price-pressures-2021-12-02"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 https://www.reuters.com/markets/rates-bonds/yellen-says-cutting-some-tariffs-chinese-goods-could-ease-price-pressures-2021-12-02}}}\uc2  her Chinese counterpart, Vice Premier Liu He, on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy issues.\par \par \uc2 NEW GOALPOSTS\par \par \uc2 In the second \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  report issued by the Biden administration, the Treasury also adjusted the three manipulation thresholds under the 2015 law to include somewhat broader measures of trade surpluses, \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange interventions\b0 \highlight\uc2  and current account surpluses.\par \par \uc2 A Treasury official said \b \highlight22\uc2 Switzerland\b0 \highlight\uc2  would have exceeded the old current account surplus threshold, and narrowly missed exceeding the new one.\par \par \uc2 "Treasury is working relentlessly to promote a stronger and more balanced global recovery that benefits American workers, including through close engagement with major economies on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 -related issues," Yellen said in a statement accompanying the report. (Reporting by David Lawder and Andrea Shalal; additional reporting by Ben Blanchard and John Revill Editing by Dan Burns, Chizu Nomiyama and Andrea Ricci) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2021-12-3T18:31:34.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020211203ehc302zbx\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw109\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal1635\pichgoal600
