\par\par \b \uc2 BUZZ-COMMENT-SNB's retreat allows for greater EUR/USD volatility\b0\par\par\uc2 244 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 November 2021\par 10:58\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2021 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Nov 17 (Reuters) - The amount of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  conducted by \b \highlight22\uc2 Switzerland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has sharply declined allowing for a lot more EUR/USD volatility and it may be prudent to expect volatility to remain elevated.\par \par \uc2 For years the \uc2 Swiss National Bank\uc2 's policy underpinned EUR/CHF and EUR/USD but weighed on EUR/USD when \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was rebalanced. The huge size of SNB flows often swamped other interest, curtailing speculation on both sides of the market and suppressing volatility.\par \par \uc2 This has changed with EUR/CHF dropping from 1.0937 to 1.0508 between Sept. 17 and Nov. 17, challenging last year's low that SNB spent 134 billion francs defending with little sign of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  this time. This is having a knock-on effect on EUR/USD which has dived 1.1690 to 1.1263 in two weeks.\par \par \uc2 EUR/USD vol which has soared from 4.5 to 7.0 in a few days will probably remain elevated and while EUR/CHF will likely break 1.0500 easing downside pressure upon EUR/USD, the SNB won't be rebalancing, so won't help cap any EUR/USD recovery either.\par \par \uc2 EUR/USD vol might reach the double digits levels that often traded before SNB \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 2010 before peaking.\par \par \uc2 For more click on\par \par \uc2 (Jeremy Boulton is a Reuters market analyst. The views expressed are his own)\par \par \uc2 Released: 2021-11-20T09:58:49.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020211117ehbh01k0p\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
