 factors to consider included how quickly the exchange rate moved, Maechler said.\par \par \uc2 Expectations of monetary policy by other central banks played a role in the valuation of the franc, with speculators watching interest rate before deciding where to place their money.\par \par \uc2 The franc also remained a safe haven for investors in times of uncertainty, she added.\par \par \uc2 "The most important driver is of course when there are uncertainties, where do I want to put my money? Often the actors come into Switzerland." (Reporting by John Revill; Editing by Michael Shields) \par \par \uc2 Released: 2021-11-9T18:29:41.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020211109ehb903z7m\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
