c2  manipulators. In contrast to the trade surplus, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has barely impacted the inflation it was intended to boost.\par \par \uc2 For more click on ]\par \par \uc2 (Jeremy Boulton is a Reuters market analyst. The views expressed are his own)\par \par \uc2 Released: 2021-11-4T10:10:46.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020211101ehb101qt5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
