\par\par \b \uc2 BUZZ-COMMENT-SNB's sledgehammer may crack its own nut\b0\par\par\uc2 230 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 3 Juli 2020\par 10:40\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright 2020 Thomson Reuters. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 July 3 (Reuters) - The massive size of \b \highlight22\uc2 Switzerland\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  may be its eventual undoing.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Switzerland\b0 \highlight\uc2  has sold between 53 billion and 100 billion francs ($56-$105.7 billion) in a few months and the impact of those flows is evident in major \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets where Swiss \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has become a dominant force.\par \par \uc2 Daily \b \highlight22\uc2 FX\b0 \highlight\uc2  volumes may be measured in trillions but there are very few players that trade billion-dollar tickets let alone do that on a daily basis. Such huge sizes require liquidity that is rarely available and in the middle of a crisis there is even less chance that the \uc2 Swiss National Bank\uc2  (SNB) will find the liquidity necessary to meet its requirements.\par \par \uc2 But there is another and potentially bigger issue. The SNB rebalances \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , converting a big proportion into dollars.\par \par \uc2 To do that the SNB must sell EUR/USD after buying EUR/CHF. Effectively the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is supporting the cross then selling back to itself. The greater its dominance the more it is effectively dealing with itself.\par \par \uc2 Trapped within this vicious circle the effectiveness of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  will decrease, while the risk of market disorder grows. For more click on\par \par \uc2 ($1 = 0.9461 Swiss francs)\par \par \uc2 (Jeremy Boulton is a Reuters market analyst. The views expressed are his own)\par \par \uc2 Released: 2020-7-6T08:40:53.000Z \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020200703eg73017tt\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
